The load images response does not respect the required structure: `[imageManagerLoadURL](https://froala.com/wysiwyg-editor/docs/options#imageManagerLoadURL "imageManagerLoadURL")` and cannot be parsed.

14

Missing image thumb.

The load images response did not contain `thumb`. Although this is not required, it is highly recommended to use `thumb`. Thumbs are used for the images displayed in the image manager, instead of displaying the full-sized image to prevent server overload.

15

Missing image URL.

The load images response did not contain `url` for an image.

21

Error during delete image request.

The HTTP request to delete an image faild. The `[imageManagerDeleteURL](https://froala.com/wysiwyg-editor/docs/options#imageManagerDeleteURL "imageManagerDeleteURL")` option may be set incorrect, the server faild to respond or a custom error was sent by the server.

22

Missing imageManagerDeleteURL option.

The `[imageManagerDeleteURL](https://froala.com/wysiwyg-editor/docs/options#imageManagerDeleteURL "imageManagerDeleteURL")` option was not set.

